{
  "$schema": "is-preview/v1",
  "tag": "is-copy-button",
  "category": "actions",
  "title": "<is-copy-button>",
  "titleHtml": true,
  "description": "Documentación y demos del componente is-copy-button de InSoft.",
  "styles": ".cluster { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }\r\n    .stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }\r\n    /* Hueco generoso: los tooltips de los 12 placements se despliegan sin taparse */\r\n    .placement-cell {\r\n      display: inline-flex;\r\n      flex-direction: column;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      gap: 0.45rem;\r\n    }\r\n    /* El nombre visible evita la \"pared de botones grises\": sin el, las 12\r\n       celdas son identicas y hay que pasar el raton para saber cual es cual. */\r\n    .placement-cell__name {\r\n      font-family: var(--is-mono, ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace);\r\n      font-size: 0.68rem;\r\n      color: var(--is-text-soft);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .placements {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(8rem, 1fr));\r\n      gap: 2.5rem 1rem;\r\n      justify-items: center;\r\n      padding: 2rem 1rem;\r\n    }\r\n    /* El demo debe dejar claro QUE se copia: valor visible, boton pegado a el\r\n       y un campo donde pegar para comprobar el resultado. */\r\n    .copy-showcase {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      gap: 1.25rem;\r\n      max-width: 34rem;\r\n    }\r\n    .copy-field__label,\r\n    .copy-proof__label {\r\n      display: block;\r\n      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\r\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\r\n      font-weight: 700;\r\n      letter-spacing: 0.06em;\r\n      text-transform: uppercase;\r\n      color: var(--is-text-soft);\r\n    }\r\n    .copy-field__row {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      gap: 0.5rem;\r\n      padding: 0.45rem 0.5rem 0.45rem 0.85rem;\r\n      border: 1px solid var(--is-border);\r\n      border-radius: 0.5rem;\r\n      background: var(--is-code-bg, var(--is-bg-elev));\r\n    }\r\n    .copy-field__value {\r\n      flex: 1;\r\n      min-width: 0;\r\n      overflow-x: auto;\r\n      white-space: nowrap;\r\n      font-family: var(--is-mono, ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace);\r\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n      color: var(--is-code-text, var(--is-text));\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .from-input {\r\n      font: inherit;\r\n      padding: 0.45em 0.7em;\r\n      border: 1px solid var(--is-border);\r\n      border-radius: 6px;\r\n      background: var(--is-bg-elev, transparent);\r\n      color: var(--is-text);\r\n      max-width: 280px;\r\n      width: 100%;\r\n    }",
  "storageKey": "docs-is-copy-button",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "<is-copy-button>",
      "lede": "Copia texto al portapapeles con feedback de éxito/error.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"copy-showcase\">\r\n            <div class=\"copy-field\">\r\n              <span class=\"copy-field__label\">Endpoint de la API</span>\r\n              <div class=\"copy-field__row\">\r\n                <code class=\"copy-field__value\" id=\"cbValue\">https://api.insoft.com.co/v1</code>\r\n                <is-copy-button from=\"cbValue\" copy-label=\"Copiar\" success-label=\"¡Copiado!\"></is-copy-button>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"copy-proof\">\r\n              <label class=\"copy-proof__label\" for=\"cbPaste\">Pega aquí para comprobarlo</label>\r\n              <input id=\"cbPaste\" class=\"from-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Ctrl+V / Cmd+V\">\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>",
          "controls": [
              {
                "control": "select",
                "prop": "attr:from",
                "label": "from",
                "options": [
                  "cbValue",
                  "my-phone",
                  "my-input.value",
                  "my-link[href]"
                ]
              },
              {
                "control": "select",
                "prop": "attr:copy-label",
                "label": "copy-label",
                "options": [
                  "Copiar",
                  "Clic para copiar",
                  "250ms",
                  "3s",
                  "full",
                  "copy (solo feedback)",
                  "none",
                  "top",
                  "top-start",
                  "top-end",
                  "right",
                  "right-start",
                  "right-end",
                  "bottom",
                  "bottom-start",
                  "bottom-end",
                  "left",
                  "left-start",
                  "left-end"
                ]
              },
              {
                "control": "select",
                "prop": "attr:success-label",
                "label": "success-label",
                "options": [
                  "¡Copiado!",
                  "¡Listo!"
                ]
              },
              {
                "control": "select",
                "prop": "attr:value",
                "label": "value",
                "options": [
                  "Labels custom",
                  "Iconos custom",
                  "Desde un botón custom",
                  "No se puede copiar",
                  "Rápido",
                  "Lento",
                  "full",
                  "copy",
                  "none",
                  "top",
                  "top-start",
                  "top-end",
                  "right",
                  "right-start",
                  "right-end",
                  "bottom",
                  "bottom-start",
                  "bottom-end",
                  "left",
                  "left-start",
                  "left-end",
                  "hola-is-copy"
                ]
              },
              {
                "control": "text",
                "prop": "attr:error-label",
                "label": "error-label"
              },
              {
                "control": "boolean",
                "prop": "attr:disabled",
                "label": "disabled"
              },
              {
                "control": "number",
                "prop": "attr:feedback-duration",
                "label": "feedback-duration",
                "min": 0,
                "max": 3000,
                "step": 1
              },
              {
                "control": "select",
                "prop": "attr:tooltip",
                "label": "tooltip",
                "options": [
                  "full",
                  "copy",
                  "none"
                ]
              },
              {
                "control": "select",
                "prop": "attr:tooltip-placement",
                "label": "tooltip-placement",
                "options": [
                  "top",
                  "top-start",
                  "top-end",
                  "right",
                  "right-start",
                  "right-end",
                  "bottom",
                  "bottom-start",
                  "bottom-end",
                  "left",
                  "left-start",
                  "left-end"
                ]
              }
          ],
          "equivNote": "from gana sobre value. Sin fuente válida emite is-error.",
          "equivHtml": "<!-- ver diagrama de ramas -->",
          "equivFlow": "<is-flowchart open-on-click animation=\"flow\">\n  <script type=\"application/json\">\n  {\n    \"flowchart\": {\n      \"title\": \"is-copy-button: fuente\",\n      \"direction\": \"TB\",\n      \"nodes\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"q\",\n          \"label\": \"tiene from?\",\n          \"shape\": \"diamond\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"a\",\n          \"label\": \"resolver #id / .value\",\n          \"shape\": \"round\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"b\",\n          \"label\": \"tiene value?\",\n          \"shape\": \"diamond\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"c\",\n          \"label\": \"copiar literal\",\n          \"shape\": \"stadium\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"e\",\n          \"label\": \"is-error\",\n          \"shape\": \"stadium\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"edges\": [\n        {\n          \"from\": \"q\",\n          \"to\": \"a\",\n          \"label\": \"si\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"from\": \"q\",\n          \"to\": \"b\",\n          \"label\": \"no\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"from\": \"b\",\n          \"to\": \"c\",\n          \"label\": \"si\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"from\": \"b\",\n          \"to\": \"e\",\n          \"label\": \"no\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n  </script>\n</is-flowchart>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "html": "<strong>Requiere contexto seguro.</strong>\r\n          <code class=\"code\">clipboard.writeText()</code> necesita HTTPS o localhost."
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<code id=\"cbValue\">https://api.insoft.com.co/v1</code>\n<is-copy-button from=\"cbValue\" copy-label=\"Copiar\" success-label=\"¡Copiado!\"></is-copy-button>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "from",
      "title": "Copiar desde otros elementos",
      "lede": "Usa <code class=\"code\">from</code> para apuntar a un <code class=\"code\">id</code>.\r\n          Si hay <code class=\"code\">value</code> y <code class=\"code\">from</code>, gana <code class=\"code\">from</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"cluster\">\r\n            <span id=\"my-phone\">+57 300 123 4567</span>\r\n            <is-copy-button from=\"my-phone\"></is-copy-button>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cluster\">\r\n            <input id=\"my-input\" class=\"from-input\" type=\"text\" value=\"Texto del usuario\" />\r\n            <is-copy-button from=\"my-input.value\"></is-copy-button>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cluster\">\r\n            <a id=\"my-link\" href=\"https://insoft.com.co\">Sitio InSoft</a>\r\n            <is-copy-button from=\"my-link[href]\"></is-copy-button>\r\n          </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span id=\"my-phone\">+57 300 123 4567</span>\n<is-copy-button from=\"my-phone\"></is-copy-button>\n\n<is-copy-button from=\"my-input.value\"></is-copy-button>\n<is-copy-button from=\"my-link[href]\"></is-copy-button>"
        }
      ]
    },
